{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16804","headline":"赋四相诗 门下侍郎平章事王缙 · 皇甫澈","name":"赋四相诗 门下侍郎平章事王缙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舟檝济巨川，山河资秀气。\n服膺究儒业，屈指取高位。\n北征戮骄悍，东守辑携贰。\n论道致巍巍，持衡无事事。\n知己不易遇，宰相固有器。\n瞻事华壁中，来者谁其嗣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}